<title>GERMANY: BfG 1996 operating profit up 3.9 pct.</title>
<headline>BfG 1996 operating profit up 3.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit			   307.5  vs 296</p>
<p>    Provisions for risks			47.3   vs 112.8</p>
<p>    Trading result				22.9   vs 83.6</p>
<p>    Administrative expenses		   1,120  vs 1,089</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is BfG Bank AG, a division of France's Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
